The test blob under test/blobs and the vectors under test/vectors are derived from
public NAIF and PDS kernels (leapseconds, planetary constants, a subset of the DE440
planetary ephemeris, and a Cassini reconstructed trajectory) through the SPICE
Toolkit as compiled by the cspice-wasm project. The kernels themselves are not in
this repository. SPICE is produced by the Navigation and Ancillary Information
Facility (NAIF) at the Jet Propulsion Laboratory; to obtain the Toolkit and kernels
go to https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/naif/toolkit.html.

The ground tools depend on cspice-wasm (https://github.com/PaulMRamirez/cspice-wasm)
at development time only; the flight library depends on nothing.
